  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Asia Resilience to Climate Change MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the Trust Fund is to increase the resilience of
 select countries (as defined below) to climate change by fostering regional cooperation, improving capacity of countries and individuals to address climate change, enhancing broader environmental resilience, supporting improved delivery and better use of weather and climate information services, and promoting innovation.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
